{
    "title": "Would You Rather?",
    "description": "Play now Would You Rather , the one and only challenge which will push your brain to the limits. In this game  you have to choose between two very difficult conundrums.\r\n\r\nThis entertainment trivia game gather many questions sent by other users..This classic game is the one played by most of youtubers community, including those doing the youtubers life.\r\n\r\nYou can play our standard game where you just need to answer question created by our team. Most of them are very challenging. This game is just suitable for adults, kids should avoid to play this game as some questions are gross.\r\n\r\nYou can also play with your friends, create a question and share it with your closest friends, ready to have lots of fun? All questions are synchronized in real time with our servers. All results you see in the game are real and updated.\r\n\r\nYou can also create your own questions and share it to the community. Try to do not make any typo as a process of reviews is taking in place and if there is some mistakes or inconsistencies we will not approve your question.  We would appreciate if you try to do capital letters on your questions. For example Mr.President instead of mr president, you will find further instructions in-game.\r\n\r\nFinally you can keep track of your questions, see how many votes your question has, you can get very surprised by the response. We promise.\r\n\r\nRemember that you can always reports questions that you think are not related to the game or are too gross or with typos.\r\n\r\nWould you rather was inspired by youtubers as luzu and jacksepticeye , similiar to our other game bottle flip challenge which was also inspired by them so in case you are one of them please feel free to use this game for your videos.\r\n\r\nEnjoy now Would You Rather !!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Play now Would You Rather , the one and only challenge which will push your brain to the limits. In this game  you have to choose between two very difficult conundrums.<br><br>This entertainment trivia game gather many questions sent by other users..This classic game is the one played by most of youtubers community, including those doing the youtubers life.<br><br>You can play our standard game where you just need to answer question created by our team. Most of them are very challenging. This game is just suitable for adults, kids should avoid to play this game as some questions are gross.<br><br>You can also play with your friends, create a question and share it with your closest friends, ready to have lots of fun? All questions are synchronized in real time with our servers. All results you see in the game are real and updated.<br><br>You can also create your own questions and share it to the community. Try to do not make any typo as a process of reviews is taking in place and if there is some mistakes or inconsistencies we will not approve your question.  We would appreciate if you try to do capital letters on your questions. For example Mr.President instead of mr president, you will find further instructions in-game.<br><br>Finally you can keep track of your questions, see how many votes your question has, you can get very surprised by the response. We promise.<br><br>Remember that you can always reports questions that you think are not related to the game or are too gross or with typos.<br><br>Would you rather was inspired by youtubers as luzu and jacksepticeye , similiar to our other game bottle flip challenge which was also inspired by them so in case you are one of them please feel free to use this game for your videos.<br><br>Enjoy now Would You Rather !!",
